# Brand icon

- Canonical PNG: `branding/assets/app-icon-1024.png` (512×512, ≥400 bytes)
- Metadata: `branding/brand.json` (`icon`, `icon_sha256`, `source`, `brand_name`, `tokens`)
- Inheritance: if `icon_sha256` matches the template stock hash, treat as **inherited** (fail until rebrand)
- Never ship stub SVG placeholders (&lt;400 bytes) as the app icon SoT
- On `BRAND-ICON-MISSING`: write a design brief in the PR; do not generate placeholder marks
- Gate: `python3 scripts/check-brand-icon.py` (see `docs/BRAND_ICON.md`)
